      "note": "init_window_mask() sets cstate.window_mask = cstate.window_size - 1 = 64MB-1 from the mismatched window size, so all subsequent window accesses use a mask far larger than the real 128KB buffer.",
      "role": "intermediate"
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
