      "function": "init_unpack",
      "line": 2252,
      "var": "window_buf",
      "code": "rar->cstate.window_buf = calloc(1, rar->cstate.window_size);",
      "note": "The actual window buffer is allocated only here, with the PRIMARY block's window size (128KB). init_unpack() is not called again during multivolume switching, so window_buf stays 128KB while window_size becomes 64MB.",
      "role": "intermediate"
    },
